<view class="page" style="{{themeStyle}}">
  <glass-nav-bar title="设置新密码" left="none" />

  <view class="header">
    <view class="title">请设置新密码</view>
    <view class="subtitle">管理员已把你的密码重置为一次性临时口令</view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice">
    为保障账号安全，建议尽快设置你自己的新密码；也可以先跳过，之后在「我的 → 账号安全 → 登录密码与密保」里随时设置。
  </view>

  <view class="form">
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="label">新密码 <text class="required">*</text></view>
      <input class="input" password placeholder="至少 8 位" value="{{newPassword}}" data-field="newPassword" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <view class="label">确认新密码 <text class="required">*</text></view>
      <input class="input" password placeholder="请再次输入新密码" value="{{confirmPassword}}" data-field="confirmPassword" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>

  <button class="btn-primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="submit">设置并进入系统</button>
  <button class="btn-plain" bindtap="skip">暂不设置，先进入系统</button>
  <view class="btn-link" bindtap="logout">退出登录</view>
</view>
